+# Spec Delta
+
+## Purpose
+Coupon rules: what a coupon takes off an order and on which days it can be used.
+
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Percentage coupon applies to the subtotal after volume discounts
+A percentage coupon SHALL take its percentage of the order's subtotal after volume discounts, rounded half up to the cent, subject to the 50%-of-gross cap on all discounts together.
+
+#### Scenario: Volume discount and 10% coupon
+- **WHEN** an order of 12 notebooks at 500 cents is priced with a 10% coupon
+- **THEN** gross is 6000, the volume discount is 600, the coupon takes 540 (10% of 5400), and goods are 4860 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Coupon without volume discount
+- **WHEN** an order of 2 items at 500 cents is priced with a 10% coupon
+- **THEN** the coupon takes 100 cents and goods are 900 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Rounding at half a cent
+- **WHEN** the subtotal after volume discounts is 1005 cents and the coupon is 10% (100.5 cents)
+- **THEN** the coupon takes 101 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Cap on all discounts
+- **WHEN** an order of 10 items at 1000 cents (gross 10000, volume discount 1000) uses a 60% coupon (5400 cents)
+- **THEN** the coupon is reduced to 4000 cents so discounts total 5000 cents, 50% of gross
+
+### Requirement: Coupon is valid on its first and last day
+A coupon SHALL be redeemable on every day from its first day to its last day, both included.
+
+#### Scenario: Last day
+- **WHEN** coupon AUTUMN is valid from 2026-09-01 to 2026-11-30 and an order is placed on 2026-11-30
+- **THEN** the coupon is accepted
+
+#### Scenario: Day after the last day
+- **WHEN** the same order is placed on 2026-12-01
+- **THEN** the coupon is refused as expired
+
+#### Scenario: First day
+- **WHEN** an order is placed on 2026-09-01
+- **THEN** the coupon is accepted
+
+#### Scenario: Day before the first day
+- **WHEN** an order is placed on 2026-08-31
+- **THEN** the coupon is refused as not valid yet
